  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bok trad folkkonst</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monograph folk tribal art - Monograf folkkonst</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet g&#xe5;r ut p&#xe5; att producera en illustrerad bok &#xf6;ver Home of Folk Art: Museum of Folk, Tribal &amp; Neglected Art&apos;s kollektion. Det finns f&#xe5;, om ens n&#xe5;gra, j&#xe4;mf&#xf6;rbara studier om traditionell Indisk folkkonst. V&#xe4;ldigt lite &#xe4;r k&#xe4;nt om denna unika konstform i v&#xe4;stv&#xe4;rlden. Provinserna Himachal Pradesh, Punjab och Haryan &#xe4;r i fokus.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to make an illustrated monograph of the Home of Folk Art: Museum of Folk, Tribal &amp; Neglected Art&apos;s collection entitled: &quot;Masterpieces of Indian Folk &amp; Tribal Art&quot;. There are few or no comparable comprehensive studies on Indian folk and tribal art. Very little is known about this unique art form in the west. The provinces Himachal Pradesh, Punjab and Haryana are in focus</narrative>
  </description>
